                "title": "Old Town Clear Crystal Knob with Rope Rosette",
                "description": "The Old Town Clear Crystal Knob with Rope Rosette is stunning with its classic design. The rope rose is one of the oldest in door hardware and for good reason. The detailing catches highlights of finishes and adds a subtle point of intrest that only adds to the door knob's elegance. However, the Classic Old Town Knob with Rope Rose's prominent feature is the clear crystal knob. It is beautiful. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n",
